    "measuredInstability": "HP-APPEND spans 3.797750 to 26.665300 microseconds within a single 30-sample run, and nearest-rank p95 selects the transient peak. Across two rounds on byte-identical code HP-APPEND flipped pass to fail while HP-CREATE flipped the other way, and HP-CREATE's baseline p95 alone moved 0.7646 to 1.7566 microseconds, a factor of 2.3.",
